# Point this at your form backend. Fastest option: a Google Apps Script Web
# App URL (see google-apps-script/Code.gs and the README) that appends each
# enquiry to a Google Sheet as its own row. Also works with a Formspree-style
# endpoint, or your own API's POST /inquiries route. Copy this file to .env
# and fill it in.
VITE_INQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
